{"id":"n73818-2-7","stage":4,"title":"장 · 酱","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73818-2-7-1","ko":"장독에 가서 장 좀 퍼 오너라.","zh":"去酱缸那儿舀些酱过来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"장독에","meaning":"酱缸","explanation":"장독：酱缸；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"장독","audio":"/audio/3f452ead2418a846bd17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73384","senseId":"1","lemma":"장독","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"장","meaning":"酱","explanation":"장：酱","readings":[{"term":"장","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73818","senseId":"2","lemma":"장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"퍼","meaning":"盛，舀","explanation":"푸다：盛，舀；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"푸다","audio":"/audio/8607b4229ee286c7dd96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83568","senseId":"1","lemma":"푸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오너라.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；너라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3f452ead2418a846","term":"장독","zh":"酱缸","audio":"/audio/3f452ead2418a846bd17.mp3","entryId":"73384","definition":"用于存放或制作酱油、大酱、辣椒酱等的缸。","pronunciation":["장ː똑"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"2dfdb434387c361c","term":"장","zh":"酱","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3","entryId":"73818","definition":"酱油、辣椒酱、大酱等的统称。","pronunciation":["장ː"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"8607b4229ee286c7","term":"푸다","zh":"盛，舀","audio":"/audio/8607b4229ee286c7dd96.mp3","entryId":"83568","definition":"把在里面的液体、粉、谷物等用勺子等弄到外面。","pronunciation":["푸다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a5faed12736adba50dbd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73818-2-7-2","ko":"네, 된장이 잘 익었을지 모르겠네요.","zh":"嗯，不知道黄豆酱是不是已经发酵好了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"된장이","meaning":"大酱","explanation":"된장：大酱；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"된장","audio":"/audio/83704f823568fd14d4d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48241","senseId":"1","lemma":"된장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"익었을지","meaning":"熟，发酵","explanation":"익다：熟，发酵；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"익다","audio":"/audio/615092c47f4ab18c0d1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63510","senseId":"3","lemma":"익다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르겠네요.","meaning":"不知道，不确定，也许","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不确定，也许；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"5","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"83704f823568fd14","term":"된장","zh":"大酱","audio":"/audio/83704f823568fd14d4d2.mp3","entryId":"48241","definition":"把做酱油后剩下的酱曲子经发酵而制成的酱。","pronunciation":["된ː장","뒌ː장"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"615092c47f4ab18c","term":"익다","zh":"熟，发酵","audio":"/audio/615092c47f4ab18c0d1f.mp3","entryId":"63510","definition":"辛奇、酒、酱等入味。","pronunciation":["익따"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不确定，也许","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"推测或猜测不确定的事宜。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6cb9a0341a39ff70b40a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.989,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73818","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":126,"sequenceScore":2.2529,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["去酱缸那儿舀些酱过来。","嗯，不知道黄豆酱是不是已经发酵好了。","周末你做了什么？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["去酱缸那儿舀些酱过来。","嗯，不知道黄豆酱是不是已经发酵好了。","周末你做了什么？"],"answer":1}]}
